  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking:\n            - Removed `IsSuccess` property (now extension method `IsSuccess()`).\n            - This avoids leaking it into API outputs; use new predicate extensions instead.\n\n            Added:\n            - Optional `ResultCode` support alongside `Status`.\n            - Built-in `ResultCodes`: ValidationFailed, NotFound, AlreadyExists, Created, Updated, etc.\n            - Extensions:\n            • `WithCode(ResultCode)`\n            • `WithDetail(key, value)`\n            • `TryGetValidationResults(...)` and `GetValidationResults()`\n            - Predicate helpers: `IsSuccess()`, `IsFailure()`, `IsError()`, `IsCancelled()`\n\n            Changed:\n            - `Result` and `Result<T>` constructors accept optional `ResultCode`.\n            - Advanced and core extensions merged into unified `ResultExtensions`.",
